
SCENARIO 11: START FROM A CATALOG BASELINE INSTEAD OF BUILDING FROM SCRATCH

Common · Shipped

  Use this when you want a fast starting point and only need to tailor it for
  your repo afterward.

TYPICAL COMMANDS

  ht init --main codex --aliases claude-code,cursor
  ht plugin list --search foundation --remote-only
  ht apply engineering-foundation

Full doc: https://github.com/harnesstap/harnesstap/blob/main/docs/scenarios/details/11-builtin-plugin.md
All scenarios: https://github.com/harnesstap/harnesstap/blob/main/docs/scenarios/scenarios.md
